    "output_token_ids_sha256": "47fad3ec1155adb7f0712b0ab80a312802ddbf0cb348803af712025f473a7a4f",
    "raw_output": "```java\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\n\npublic final class Solution {\n\n    public static Long reconcileLedger(long opening, List<long[]> entries) {\n        if (entries == null || entries.isEmpty()) {\n            return opening;\n        }\n\n        long currentBalance = opening;\n        long lastId = -1;\n\n        for (long[] entry : entries) {\n            long id = entry[0];\n            long kind = entry[1];\n            long amount = entry[2];\n\n            // Validate id uniqueness\n            if (id == lastId) {\n                return null; // Reject duplicate ids\n            }\n            lastId = id;\n\n            // Validate kind\n            if (kind != 1 && kind != -1) {\n                return null; // Reject other kinds\n            }\n\n            // Validate amount\n            if (amount <= 0) {\n                return null; // Reject non-positive amounts\n            }\n\n            // Perform arithmetic\n            if (kind == 1) {\n                currentBalance += amount;\n            } else {\n                currentBalance -= amount;\n            }\n        }\n\n        return currentBalance;\n    }\n}\n```<|im_end|>",
